      "value": "It seems like at least a portion of the types are taken from .NET and Unity libraries, so reflection will get you part of the way there.. Nodes in System seem to be in .NET's System namespace, and UnityEngine in Unity's UnityEngine namespace.",
      "viewerReactions": null
