      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My suggestion about the instance methods is to make it appear in the first argument of the signature so that everything looks like static methods.\n\nFor example, the signature corresponding to `Transform.Find (instance method)` would better be `Find__UnityEngineTransform_SystemString__UnityEngineTransform`.",
